flowchart TD
  Input[用户任务] --> Detect[识别仓库]
  Detect --> Route{任务模式}
  Route --> Generate[Generate\n计划→补丁→验证]
  Route --> Review[Review\n读取 diff→分析→发现]
  Route --> Fix[Fix\n复现→定位→修复→回归]
  Route --> Test[Test\n推断命令→执行→分类]
  Route --> Scaffold[Scaffold\n模板→变量→安装→检查]
  Generate --> Evidence[统一证据模型]
  Review --> Evidence
  Fix --> Evidence
  Test --> Evidence
  Scaffold --> Evidence
  Evidence --> Report[报告/JSONL/可撤销变更]
